			"x": -440,
			"y": -320,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## What the system does\nKey abstractions and their relations for the people who use it.\n\nTypical diagrams: class, object, state machine.\n\n*Audience: end users, analysts*"
		},
		{
			"id": "development",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 500,
			"y": -360,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 320,
