			"type": "text",
			"x": 520,
			"y": -320,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## How the code is organised\nModules, packages, layers and their dependencies.\n\nTypical diagrams: component, package.\n\n*Audience: developers, managers*"
		},
		{
			"id": "process",
			"type": "group",
